  "title": "Lemon Whipped Pie",
  "description": "Condensed milk is whipped into a froth. Then sugar, lemon juice and gelatin are whipped into that, and finally, crushed pineapple gets stirred in. The filling is poured into a pre-baked crust and chilled, and garnished with maraschino cherries.",
